"P3432321611" "Orders"
// DetailString :
"P872683055" "One of the soldiers had written orders to ambush you, tracking you through a device given to you by Brick Johnson. The orders come from a Lieutenant Fossil, who must not be happy with your current status and decided to put a hit out on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Doohickey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3397709879" "Crate Unlocker"
// DetailString :
"P3471518363" "This hightech marvel will unlock the specific crate with the bearer bonds"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2586035244" "I have a nice, simple smash and grab for you. There's a warehouse in Port Oakes that just got a shipment of bearer bonds in. I've got a doohickey that will override the lock on the crates, and since you'll be doing all the hard work, I'll even make it an attractive 90/10 split, where I will only take 10% of the profit? This job is too good to pass up!"
// AcceptString :
"P2955229434" "Steal the bearer bonds from the warehouse"
// SendOffString :
"P400384393" "Here's the doohickey, just wave it in front of the crate. There will probably be some port authority guys there, but you can handle them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2876856734" "Steal bearer bonds"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3011529557" "You are not done yet!"
